	<name>College Ave orbit · FUTURE sites · 10-23 15:51</name>
	<description><![CDATA[Generated by scripts/tours/gen_orbit_tour.py. Opens on the Wells Fargo lot looking toward the Claremont Hotel (heading 76); orbits 3 times around 8 FUTURE sites (centre 37.85749,-122.25291, radius 317 m) at 250 ft; ends over Russell at Benvenue looking east (heading 85). Camera-only: load with geometry.kml, college-elmwood.kml, college-opportunity-sites.kml and elmwood-labels.kmz.]]></description>
